    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>Today is supposed to be your daughter's birthday, But something happened in this town. Almost everyone has turn into a Monster. <br>You need to protect your daughter and her birthday party!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/fcb7e3084544c44e50b531dca355fcf6.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Happy Z-Day brings you a challenging Top-Down Shooting, Tower-Defense-Like gameplay.<br>You need to wisely use your resources to Construct Buildings, Upgrade Equipment or Resupply Ammos. And defend in-come waves of Zombies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game World</h2>The Game take place in a House or a Farm with a barn, or even on the roof. Depends on the levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/03f3e952a92ca42e64afaadd4de60d6e.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemy</h2>The enemies you need to fight is those who got infected by the virus and turn into Zombies.<br><br>Each type of Zombies has different behaviors.<br><br>Some type of Zombies will get raged when it's night.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/2247f037132e9d6aaa388e1ca58faed7.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Goal</h2>The Goal is to survive specific number of nights, then your daughter can finally celebrate her birthday.<br><br>If you die, or your daughter's birthday party got destroyed, you will Lose!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>Today is supposed to be your daughter's birthday, But something happened in this town. Almost everyone has turn into a Monster. <br>You need to protect your daughter and her birthday party!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/fcb7e3084544c44e50b531dca355fcf6.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Happy Z-Day brings you a challenging Top-Down Shooting, Tower-Defense-Like gameplay.<br>You need to wisely use your resources to Construct Buildings, Upgrade Equipment or Resupply Ammos. And defend in-come waves of Zombies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game World</h2>The Game take place in a House or a Farm with a barn, or even on the roof. Depends on the levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/03f3e952a92ca42e64afaadd4de60d6e.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemy</h2>The enemies you need to fight is those who got infected by the virus and turn into Zombies.<br><br>Each type of Zombies has different behaviors.<br><br>Some type of Zombies will get raged when it's night.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589260/extras/2247f037132e9d6aaa388e1ca58faed7.avif?t=1620794597\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Goal</h2>The Goal is to survive specific number of nights, then your daughter can finally celebrate her birthday.<br><br>If you die, or your daughter's birthday party got destroyed, you will Lose!",
